{"id":"495bb24d4506a7c2","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-sequence-code.md","title":"Delimiter Coding of Nonempty Finite Sequences","display":"df-smullyan-sequence-code — Delimiter Coding of Nonempty Finite Sequences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-sequence-code"],"display":"df-smullyan-sequence-code — Delimiter Coding of Nonempty Finite Sequences","source":"第 III 章 pp. 32–33（PDF 49–50）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-sequence-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-sequence-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-sequence-code — Delimiter Coding of Nonempty Finite Sequences"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 32–33（PDF 49–50）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" href=\"?note=e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering\">92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E:E_E\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_E:E_E\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为规范十三进制编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{12}=\\mathtt{\\#}\">\\(\\sigma_{12}=\\mathtt{\\#}\\)</span>，其码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=12\">\\(\\delta=12\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{13}(n)\">\\(D_{13}(n)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的规范十三进制位串（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{13}(0)=\\langle0\\rangle\">\\(D_{13}(0)=\\langle0\\rangle\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_{11}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:12\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(D_{13}(n))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&amp;\\coloneqq\ng_E(\\mathtt{\\#}E_{a_1}\\mathtt{\\#}\\cdots E_{a_k}\\mathtt{\\#})\\quad(a_i\\in K_{11}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}_E(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a),\\\\\nx\\in_E q&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;\n(q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;x=a_i),\\\\\nx\\prec_{E,q}y&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;[q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\nx,y\\in_E q\\land\\min\\{i:a_i=x\\}&lt;\\min\\{i:a_i=y\\}].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_{11}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:12\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(D_{13}(n))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&amp;\\coloneqq\ng_E(\\mathtt{\\#}E_{a_1}\\mathtt{\\#}\\cdots E_{a_k}\\mathtt{\\#})\\quad(a_i\\in K_{11}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}_E(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a),\\\\\nx\\in_E q&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;\n(q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;x=a_i),\\\\\nx\\prec_{E,q}y&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;[q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\nx,y\\in_E q\\land\\min\\{i:a_i=x\\}&lt;\\min\\{i:a_i=y\\}].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个元素是非空且不含分隔符的规范表达式，故按 # 分割给出唯一解码。定义允许重复元素，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 比较首次出现的位置。原书该章的 Seq 用于非空形成序列/证明；这里不把仅一个 # 默认为合法空序列码。</p>\n<p>所有有意义的原书项/公式不含 #，因此都可作为序列元素。此编号不同于本地素数幂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span>，也不同于第 IV 章为任意有限数对集合构造的框架编码。SeqNum 的拼接一律左结合，特别是元素码为 0 时也不能改成右结合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g_E:E_E\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{12}=\\mathtt{\\#}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=12","display":false},{"tex":"D_{13}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"D_{13}(0)=\\langle0\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nK_{11}&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:12\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(D_{13}(n))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(a_1,\\ldots,a_k)&\\coloneqq\ng_E(\\mathtt{\\#}E_{a_1}\\mathtt{\\#}\\cdots E_{a_k}\\mathtt{\\#})\\quad(a_i\\in K_{11}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Seq}_E(q)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a),\\\\\nx\\in_E q&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;\n(q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;x=a_i),\\\\\nx\\prec_{E,q}y&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in K_{11}^k\\;[q=\\operatorname{SeqNum}_E(\\vec a)\\land\nx,y\\in_E q\\land\\min\\{i:a_i=x\\}<\\min\\{i:a_i=y\\}].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode}","display":false}],"bytes":2027,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"f1638d16173e7b51","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]]"}],"outgoing":["e05c7a445ae4a4cd"]}